+/*
+ * dd says D_NOBRKUP (its bdevsw row points at ddflag), so the kernel's gen_strategy no longer
+ * cuts block requests for it and dd cuts them itself, into the pieces gen_strategy and
+ * buf_breakup made, one command per piece:
+ *   - a request of at most a page: one command, as it comes;
+ *   - a page list (B_PAGEIO) longer than a page: a command per page, at the page's physical
+ *     address, every page tried;
